libxtc (1.30.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat: xtc_accel -- attached-compute (GPU/NPU) fiber-parking bridge.
    xtc_accel_probe enumerates present GPU (render node) and NPU (accel
    subsystem) devices; xtc_accel_wait_fence parks a fiber on a
    completion fence fd (sync_file / dma-fence) via the loop-readiness
    path with no OS thread held; xtc_accel_run_blocking is the
    xtc_blocking fallback for fence-less runtimes.  GPU and NPU are one
    abstraction (both DRM devices with the same fence-fd completion);
    libxtc links no vendor runtime -- the consumer submits and supplies
    the fence.  Configure with --with-accel=auto|yes|no (default auto:
    on where the Linux DRM/accel subsystem is present; --without-accel
    to disable).

