  * Performance: the per-loop proc table lock is now STRIPED (16
    stripes keyed by local_id, like xtc_chash), so concurrent xtc_send
    to procs with different local_ids no longer serialize on one
    per-carrier mutex -- the measured PostgreSQL fiber-per-session
